      <profiles>
        <profile name="Whirling Dervishes" id="aba6-8b49-af2b-e4fd" hidden="true" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">The ritual Dance of the Dervishes is hypnotic to witness, and it is as graceful as it is deadly. All Ranged attacks against Dervishes suffer -1 DICE penalty. Dervishes do not suffer the normal -1 DICE to hit for fighting with an Off-Hand weapon.</characteristic>
