        <profile name="Trample" id="f09d-3206-6514-c294" hidden="false" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">ACTION: A Brazen Bull can take a Trample ACTION. If it does so, it can make a Melee Attack that must target an enemy model that is Down. A Trample Melee Attack does not use a Melee Weapon and has the IGNORE ARMOUR Keyword.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
