        <profile name="Counterattack" id="4c80-17c0-acea-89c8" hidden="false" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">When an enemy model misses the Teğmen, or a friendly model within 1” of a Teğmen, with a Melee Attack, the Teğmen may make a single Melee Attack against the enemy model as a reaction.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Mujaahid" id="9f39-0732-bf94-d1c8" hidden="false" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">When you first hire this model to your warband you may choose one of the listed Martial Disciplines for them. A Teğmen may only have one Martial Discipline and you may never change it out for any other.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
