                <profile name="Sparkpowder Ammunition" id="71fb-43b5-da89-15f1" hidden="false" typeId="7079-589c-df69-fa7e" typeName="Battlekit">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Type" typeId="3f15-74a1-4d35-3642">Equipment</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Range" typeId="2b32-2f45-9c06-7a77">-</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="5093-5528-b08f-1496">-</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">If a model is hit by a weapon using Sparkpowder Ammunition, all Attacks it makes are at -1D to hit until the end of its next activation. This does not stack.

Can only be used with Jezzails, Alaybozan, Halberd-Guns, Siege Jezzails and Machineguns.</characteristic>
