                    <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="4834-43a9-1c93-9062">Adds the keyword ARMOR PIERCING to Jezzails, Alaybozan, Halberd-Guns or Siege Jezzails weared by the model. This equipment can be taken in place of Alchemical Ammo, and you cannot gain the benefit of both. In addition it cannot be taken on units or items that come equipped with Alchemical Ammunition, such as Masterwork Jezzails or the Mamluk Faris.</characteristic>
