                <characteristic name="Rules" typeId="87f0-637b-734a-22eb">Weight of His Word: Minor Injuries caused by the Chain Kura are treated as Down results instead.
Once a Ranged Attack has been made with this weapon, It cannot be used again.</characteristic>
